  "notes": [
    "Predeclared checkpoint selection is primary-final precedence, not best observed reward. Single independent seed; no optional stopping or checkpoint/mode reselection, no discovery pooling. Control and treatment share fresh deck and action streams within anchor. Same Standard10,slumbot_free,corrected_cfr96 hashes as parent. Primary replication gate: all3 deltas positive and >=one nominal95percent pair-CI lower positive, allOOD/raw/hash checks pass. Report simultaneous Bonferroni98.333percent intervals as a stronger secondary check; do not interpret nominal one-of-three gate as familywise significance.",
    "No new environment training hands or Slumbot games. If replication fails, do not scale this configuration; investigate fixed-weight hand-group gradient noise. If it passes, separately assess external sampled-policy validation. Parent147456 discovery hands are never included in this independent sample. Required success remains >=100000 fresh Slumbot hands on one frozen policy with positive95percent lower bound.",
    "18 preflight tests passed, including raw evidence rejection, common stream identity, exact self cancellation, CI arithmetic, and separation of nominal versus multiplicity-adjusted gates. No other AlphaHoldem process remains. Original parent outputs are read-only inputs.",
    "First launch aborted at duplicate-process preflight before any snapshot or games because the parent PowerShell command also contains the launcher name. Restricted duplicate detection to Python interpreters and added a parent-shell/self/other-interpreter regression test.19 tests now pass; seeds,budgets,checkpoint and evaluation semantics unchanged.",
    "Independent replication completed; source/checkpoint hashes and raw evidence audit PASS. Analyze and finish the same record before selecting any next experiment. No Slumbot success claim.",
    "Read-only external-readiness review identified that current full deal/action fingerprinting can miss shared deals when stochastic policies choose different actions. No current internal evaluation semantics were changed and no external sessions were started. If independent replication passes, strengthen/test action-independent deal auditing before sampled external assessment."
  ],
  "result": {
    "summary": "Completed98304 independent internal hands with valid frozen evidence. The registered sampled final replication gate failed: deltas+1.913,-1.276,+12.192bb/100; all Bonferroni intervals cross zero.",
    "conclusion": "CFR96 nominal positive effect replicated, but slumbot_free direction was negative and Standard10 CI crosses zero. The unchanged1M configuration has not established consistent multi-anchor improvement. No discovery pooling,checkpoint reselection,new training,or Slumbot games occurred.",
    "decision": "INDEPENDENT_INTERNAL_REPLICATION_FAILED",
    "next_step": "Do not scale unchanged training or promote this checkpoint to Slumbot. Start a separately preregistered fixed-weight whole-hand-group actor-gradient-noise diagnostic at original source and1M mature endpoint, with non-mutating probes and complete physical accounting. Defer conditional stochastic external-audit repair until external testing is warranted."
  },
